    "text": "<p>Nylon<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn></math> is made up of hexamethylenediamine <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> and&nbsp;adipic acid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>HCOO</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>COOH</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>HCOO</mi><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub><mi>COOH</mi></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/df846fff-7d15-45c3-87b4-2c794e8e557d-image.png\" style=\"width: 504px; height: 148px;\" /></p>",
